      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate.</li>\n<li>A statement submitted by Boq\u1e6dor ibn Sisinne, the overseer in Bads\u0101, of what is in his possession by way of the yield of the seed-advance</li>\n<li>from the produce of the \u1e35ar\u0101j\u012b\u00a0year four-hundred and one, and what is in hand</li>\n<li>in his possession, according to what is testified by his statement to the prosperous office in the d\u0101r al-\u02bfizz,</li>\n<li>for this aforementioned year, and what remains in the name of the cultivators, \u00a0</li>\n<li>in their possession or as having been returned by them; also what was brought to\u00a0him from the \u0161ar\u012bf \u02beIsma\u02bf\u012bl ibn al-Q\u0101sim\u00a0</li>\n<li>al-Ja\u02bffar\u012b for the disposition of the kar\u0101j\u012b year four-hundred and two, what has\u00a0been granted from this\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">for the seed-advance of the estate known as Bads\u0101 for the kar\u0101j\u012b year\u00a0 four-hundred and two.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and what has been transferred to \u02bfAbdall\u0101h ibn Malik, the surveyor, for the\u00a0kar\u0101j\u012b year four-hundred and two.\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">He has signed it and has pledged to submit it and return it to the warehouse of\u00a0 the sultan in the estate</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">known as Bads\u0101. All of it is reckoned in the type of wayba known as 'the small'\u00a0 [\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Of the various kinds of produce: Two-hundred and forty-nine, a half and an eighth.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Wheat: Ninety-seven irdabbs.\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">What is in hand of this in the possession of Boq\u1e6dor ibn Sisinne: thirty-four and a half irdabbs. What has been returned of the produce of the year one: fifty-six, a third and an eighth irdabbs.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">What remains in the name of the cultivators: Six, a third and an eighth irdabbs. </li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
